{"trial_id": "sb__sales-pivot-analysis__sz5__random__s2", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "sales-pivot-analysis", "pool_size": 5, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 2, "gt_slugs": ["pdf", "xlsx"], "gt_positions": [0, 2], "n_candidates": 5, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 128.9, "agent_stdout_tail": "The file has been created successfully at `/root/demographic_analysis.xlsx`. Here's a summary of what was built:\n\n**Data pipeline:**\n- Extracted 2,454 population records from the 74-page PDF (SA2_CODE, SA2_NAME, STATE, POPULATION_2023)\n- Loaded 2,450 income records from `income.xlsx` (EARNERS, MEDIAN_INCOME, MEAN_INCOME)\n- Merged on SA2_CODE \u2192 2,450 combined rows\n\n**Quartile cuts applied to MEDIAN_INCOME:**\n- Q1 \u2264 $51,436 (647 regions)\n- Q2 \u2264 $58,213 (601 regions)\n- Q3 \u2264 $65,778 (601 regions)\n- Q4 > $65,778 (601 regions)\n\n**5 sheets created:**\n\n| Sheet | Contents |\n|---|---|\n| **Population by State** | Pivot \u2014 Rows: STATE, Values: Sum of POPULATION_2023 |\n| **Earners by State** | Pivot \u2014 Rows: STATE, Values: Sum of EARNERS |\n| **Regions by State** | Pivot \u2014 Rows: STATE, Values: Count of SA2 regions |\n| **State Income Quartile** | Pivot \u2014 Rows: STATE \u00d7 Cols: Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4, Values: Sum of EARNERS |\n| **SourceData** | Full data table with enriched `Quarter` and `Total` (EARNERS \u00d7 MEDIAN_INCOME) columns |\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": true, "test_log_tail": "::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_uses_correct_aggregation[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_col_field[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[SA2_CODE-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[SA2_NAME-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[STA