{"trial_id": "sb__sales-pivot-analysis__sz20__hard__s3", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "sales-pivot-analysis", "pool_size": 20, "noise_mode": "hard", "seed": 3, "gt_slugs": ["pdf", "xlsx"], "gt_positions": [6, 14], "n_candidates": 20, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 283.1, "agent_stdout_tail": "`/root/demographic_analysis.xlsx` has been created successfully. Here's a summary of what was built:\n\n**Data processed:**\n- **population.pdf** \u2014 74 pages, 2,454 SA2 regions with STATE and POPULATION_2023\n- **income.xlsx** \u2014 2,450 rows with EARNERS, MEDIAN_INCOME, MEAN_INCOME\n- **Merged** on SA2_CODE \u2192 2,450 combined rows\n\n**Income quartile boundaries** (based on MEDIAN_INCOME across all regions):\n- Q1 \u2264 $51,436 | Q2 \u2264 $58,213 | Q3 \u2264 $65,778 | Q4 > $65,778\n\n**5 sheets created:**\n\n| # | Sheet | Pivot Structure |\n|---|-------|----------------|\n| 1 | Population by State | Rows: STATE \u2192 Sum of POPULATION_2023 |\n| 2 | Earners by State | Rows: STATE \u2192 Sum of EARNERS |\n| 3 | Regions by State | Rows: STATE \u2192 Count of SA2 Regions |\n| 4 | State Income Quartile | Rows: STATE \u00d7 Cols: Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 \u2192 Sum of EARNERS |\n| 5 | SourceData | All 2,450 rows with added `Quarter` and `Total` (EARNERS \u00d7 MEDIAN_INCOME) columns |\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_uses_correct_aggregation[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_col_field[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[SA2_CODE-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[SA2_NAME-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[STATE-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_requ