{"trial_id": "sb__sales-pivot-analysis__sz20__hard__s4", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "sales-pivot-analysis", "pool_size": 20, "noise_mode": "hard", "seed": 4, "gt_slugs": ["pdf", "xlsx"], "gt_positions": [2, 7], "n_candidates": 20, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 202.2, "agent_stdout_tail": "`/root/demographic_analysis.xlsx` has been created successfully with all 5 sheets and 4 pivot tables:\n\n**Data summary:**\n- Merged 2,450 SA2 regions from the population PDF + income Excel\n- 8 Australian states/territories\n- Quartile ranges assigned to all regions based on `MEDIAN_INCOME` distribution (613 / 612 / 612 / 613 per quartile)\n\n**Sheets created:**\n1. **Population by State** \u2014 pivot: STATE rows \u2192 Sum of POPULATION_2023\n2. **Earners by State** \u2014 pivot: STATE rows \u2192 Sum of EARNERS\n3. **Regions by State** \u2014 pivot: STATE rows \u2192 Count of SA2 regions\n4. **State Income Quartile** \u2014 pivot: STATE rows \u00d7 Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 columns \u2192 Sum of EARNERS\n5. **SourceData** \u2014 2,450 rows with all original columns plus:\n   - `Quarter` (Q1\u2013Q4 based on MEDIAN_INCOME percentile cut)\n   - `Total` (EARNERS \u00d7 MEDIAN_INCOME)\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": true, "test_log_tail": "::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_uses_correct_aggregation[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_col_field[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[SA2_CODE-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[SA2_NAME-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[STATE-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_required_column[POPULATION_2023-<lambda>]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_