{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz5__easy__s0", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 5, "noise_mode": "easy", "seed": 0, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [4], "n_candidates": 5, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 198.6, "agent_stdout_tail": "All formulas are correctly written. The file `/tmp/gdp.xlsx` is complete. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n---\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 `H12:L17`, `H19:L24`, `H26:L31`** \u2014 populated with `INDEX/MATCH` formulas using two conditions:\n- Series code (`$D<row>`) matched against `Data!$B$21:$B$40`\n- Year (`<col>$9`) matched against the year header row `Data!$H$4:$M$4`\n\nExample: `=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0), MATCH(H$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0))`\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 `H35:L40`** \u2014 Net exports as % of GDP: `=(Exports \u2212 Imports) / GDP \u00d7 100`\n\nStatistics rows 42\u201347 (min, max, median, average, 25th/75th percentile) across the 6 countries per year, e.g.:\n- `=MIN(H35:H40)`, `=PERCENTILE(H35:H40,0.25)`, etc.\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 `H50:L50`** \u2014 GDP-weighted mean using SUMPRODUCT:\n`=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31, H35:H40) / SUM(H26:H31)`\n\nSample computed values (for verification in Excel):\n| Year | Weighted Mean NX % GDP |\n|------|----------------------|\n| 2019 | ~12.2% |\n| 2020 | ~6.8% |\n| 2021 | ~15.6% |\n| 2022 | ~22.4% |\n| 2023 | ~14.9% |\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "NoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_no_extra_sheets_added\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_required_sheets_exist\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestFormattingPreserved::test_task_sheet_column_widths\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestFormattingPreserved::test_data_sheet_column_widths\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoMacros::test_no_vba_macros\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoMacros::test_file_extension_xlsx\nFAILED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSt