{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz10__random__s1", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 10, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 1, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [3], "n_candidates": 10, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 283.3, "agent_stdout_tail": "All formulas are correctly in place. The `gdp.xlsx` file has been updated with:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 `H12:L17`, `H19:L24`, `H26:L31`** \u2014 INDEX&MATCH lookup using two conditions:\n```\n=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D<row>, Data!$B$21:$B$40, 0), MATCH(<col>$9, Data!$H$4:$M$4, 0))\n```\n- Row dimension: matches the series code in column D against `Data!B21:B40`\n- Column dimension: matches the year in row 9 against `Data!H4:M4`\n\n**Step 2a \u2014 `H35:L40`** \u2014 Net exports as % of GDP:\n```\n=(Exports - Imports) / GDP \u00d7 100\n```\ne.g. `=(H12-H19)/H26*100` for UAE\n\n**Step 2b \u2014 `H42:L47`** \u2014 Per-year statistics across the 6 GCC countries:\n- MIN, MAX, MEDIAN, AVERAGE, PERCENTILE(\u2026,0.25), PERCENTILE(\u2026,0.75)\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 `H50:L50`** \u2014 GDP-weighted mean using SUMPRODUCT:\n```\n=SUMPRODUCT(H35:H40, H26:H31) / SUM(H26:H31)\n```\nExpected weighted mean values: **12.2% (2019), 6.8% (2020), 15.6% (2021), 22.4% (2022), 14.9% (2023)**.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_exports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_imports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_gdp_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2NetExportsCalculation::test_net_exports_pct_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2Statistics::test_statistics_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep3WeightedMean::test_weighted_mean_has_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_no_extra_sheets_added\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.p