{"trial_id": "sb__offer-letter-generator__sz10__hard__s4", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "offer-letter-generator", "pool_size": 10, "noise_mode": "hard", "seed": 4, "gt_slugs": ["docx"], "gt_positions": [3], "n_candidates": 10, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 695.5, "agent_stdout_tail": "All placeholders are correctly filled. The output at `root/offer_letter_filled.docx` (which maps to `/root/offer_letter_filled.docx`) contains:\n\n- **All placeholders replaced** \u2014 candidate name, position, department, dates, salary, bonuses, equity, PTO, deadlines, HR contact, etc.\n- **Relocation section** \u2014 `RELOCATION_PACKAGE` is `Yes`, so the `{{IF_RELOCATION}}...{{END_IF_RELOCATION}}` markers are stripped and the content is kept: *\"You are eligible for a relocation package of $15,000. This includes moving expenses and temporary housing for 30 days.\"*\n- **Split placeholder** (`{{DEPART` / `MENT}}`) handled correctly via paragraph-level reconstruction.\n- **Nested tables** (Basic Information + Compensation) fully filled.\n- **Header** \u2014 `Document ID: OFFER-2024-00847`\n- **Footer** \u2014 `Confidential - Nexus Technologies Inc. Internal Use Only`\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": true, "test_log_tail": "test_outputs.py::test_nested_table_value[DEPARTMENT] PASSED       [ 72%]\n.tests/test_outputs.py::test_nested_table_value[BASE_SALARY] PASSED      [ 77%]\n.tests/test_outputs.py::test_nested_table_value[SIGNING_BONUS] PASSED    [ 83%]\n.tests/test_outputs.py::test_nested_table_value[EQUITY_SHARES] PASSED    [ 88%]\n.tests/test_outputs.py::test_nested_table_value[MANAGER_NAME] PASSED     [ 94%]\n.tests/test_outputs.py::test_conditional_section PASSED                  [100%]\n\n==================================== PASSES ====================================\n=========================== short test summary info ============================\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::test_no_remaining_placeholders\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::tes