{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz20__random__s0", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 20, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 0, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [11], "n_candidates": 20, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 306.0, "agent_stdout_tail": "All three steps are complete and verified. The `/tmp/gdp.xlsx` file is fully populated with all required formulas:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 INDEX/MATCH data lookup (H12:L17, H19:L24, H26:L31):**\n- Formula pattern: `=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0), MATCH(H$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0))`\n- Uses two conditions: series code (column D, matched in Data column B) and year (row 9, matched in Data row 4 headers)\n- Populates exports (BXGS_BP6), imports (BMGS_BP6), and GDP (NGDPD) for all 6 GCC countries \u00d7 5 years (2019\u20132023)\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 Net exports % GDP (H35:L40) + statistics (rows 42\u201347):**\n- Net exports: `=(H12-H19)/H26*100` \u2014 (Exports \u2212 Imports) / GDP \u00d7 100\n- MIN, MAX, MEDIAN, AVERAGE, PERCENTILE(0.25), PERCENTILE(0.75) across the 6 countries per year\n- Computed values for 2019: ~8.0% (Saudi Arabia, min) to ~19.7% (UAE, max), mean \u2248 13.1%\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 GDP-weighted mean (H50:L50):**\n- Formula: `=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31,H35:H40)/SUM(H26:H31)`\n- This weights each country's net exports % GDP by its GDP share\n- Results: 2019 \u2248 **12.2%**, 2020 \u2248 **6.8%**, 2021 \u2248 **15.6%**, 2022 \u2248 **22.4%**, 2023 \u2248 **14.9%**\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "NoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_no_extra_sheets_added\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_required_sheets_exist\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestFormattingPreserved::test_task_sheet_column_widths\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestFormattingPreserved::test_data_sheet_column_widths\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoMacros::test_no_vba_