{"trial_id": "sb__sales-pivot-analysis__sz100__easy__s1", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "sales-pivot-analysis", "pool_size": 100, "noise_mode": "easy", "seed": 1, "gt_slugs": ["pdf", "xlsx"], "gt_positions": [12, 20], "n_candidates": 100, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 433.1, "agent_stdout_tail": "`/root/demographic_analysis.xlsx` has been created successfully (176 KB). Here's a summary of what was built:\n\n---\n\n**Data sources merged:**\n- **Population PDF** (74 pages, 2,454 SA2 regions) \u2192 SA2_CODE, SA2_NAME, STATE, POPULATION_2023\n- **Income XLSX** (2,450 rows) \u2192 SA2_CODE, SA2_NAME, EARNERS, MEDIAN_INCOME, MEAN_INCOME\n- Joined on SA2_CODE; all 2,450 income rows matched a state\n\n**Income quartile boundaries** (based on MEDIAN_INCOME distribution across all regions):\n- Q1 \u2264 $51,436 \u00b7 Q2 \u2264 $58,213 \u00b7 Q3 \u2264 $65,778 \u00b7 Q4 > $65,778\n- 45 rows with suppressed income (`np`) have NULL Quarter/Total\n\n---\n\n**5 sheets created:**\n\n| Sheet | Content |\n|---|---|\n| **Population by State** | STATE \u00d7 Sum of POPULATION_2023 (+ Grand Total) + pivot metadata |\n| **Earners by State** | STATE \u00d7 Sum of EARNERS (+ Grand Total) + pivot metadata |\n| **Regions by State** | STATE \u00d7 Count of SA2 regions (+ Grand Total) + pivot metadata |\n| **State Income Quartile** | STATE rows \u00d7 Q1/Q2/Q3/Q4 columns \u00d7 Sum of EARNERS (cross-tab) + pivot metadata |\n| **SourceData** | All 2,450 rows with 9 columns: SA2_CODE, SA2_NAME, STATE, POPULATION_2023, EARNERS, MEDIAN_INCOME, MEAN_INCOME, **Quarter**, **Total** (EARNERS \u00d7 MEDIAN_INCOME) |\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_uses_correct_aggregation[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestPivotTableConfiguration::test_pivot_col_field[State Income Quartile-sum-quarter]\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSourceDataSheet::test_source_data_has_require