{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz20__easy__s1", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 20, "noise_mode": "easy", "seed": 1, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [10], "n_candidates": 20, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 291.5, "agent_stdout_tail": "All three steps are complete. Here's a summary of what was done to `gdp.xlsx`:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 INDEX/MATCH lookups (H12:L17, H19:L24, H26:L31)**\nEach cell uses a two-condition INDEX/MATCH to pull from `Data` rows 21\u201340:\n```\n=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D12, Data!$B$21:$B$40, 0), MATCH(H$9, Data!$H$4:$M$4, 0))\n```\n- First MATCH finds the row by series code (column D condition)\n- Second MATCH finds the column by year (row 9 condition)\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 Net exports % of GDP (H35:L40) and statistics (H42:L47)**\n- Net exports formula: `=(H12-H19)/H26*100` (Exports minus Imports, divided by GDP \u00d7 100)\n- Statistics: `MIN`, `MAX`, `MEDIAN`, `AVERAGE`, `PERCENTILE(...,0.25)`, `PERCENTILE(...,0.75)` over H35:H40\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 GDP-weighted mean (H50:L50)**\n```\n=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31, H35:H40) / SUM(H26:H31)\n```\nVerified result for 2019: **12.22%** weighted mean net exports as % of GDP for the GCC.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_exports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_imports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_gdp_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2NetExportsCalculation::test_net_exports_pct_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2Statistics::test_statistics_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep3WeightedMean::test_weighted_mean_has_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_no_extra_sheets_added\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_required_sheets_exist\nPASS