{"trial_id": "sb__setup-fuzzing-py__sz5__hard__s3", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "setup-fuzzing-py", "pool_size": 5, "noise_mode": "hard", "seed": 3, "gt_slugs": ["discover-important-function", "fuzzing-python", "setup-env"], "gt_positions": [1, 2, 3], "n_candidates": 5, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 614.8, "agent_stdout_tail": "All steps completed successfully:\n\n**Step 1 \u2013 `libraries.txt`**: Listed all 5 libraries at `/app/arrow`, `/app/black`, `/app/ipython`, `/app/minisgl`, `/app/ujson`.\n\n**Step 2 \u2013 Analysis notes** (`notes_for_testing.txt` for each lib):\n- **arrow**: targets `arrow.get()` / `DateTimeParser.parse_iso()` \u2014 datetime string parsing\n- **black**: targets `black.format_str()` \u2014 arbitrary Python source formatting + idempotency oracle\n- **ipython**: targets `TransformerManager.transform_cell()` / `check_complete()` \u2014 IPython magic syntax parsing\n- **minisgl**: targets argparse-based `parse_args()` \u2014 CLI argument validation (GPU deps mocked out)\n- **ujson**: targets `ujson.loads()` / `ujson.dumps()` \u2014 JSON encode/decode (C extension)\n\n**Step 3 \u2013 `fuzz.py` drivers**: Atheris/LibFuzzer harnesses for all 5 libraries using `FuzzedDataProvider` for structured inputs and appropriate exception catch lists.\n\n**Step 4 \u2013 `.venv` environments**: Python virtualenvs created at `/app/<lib>/.venv` with `atheris` and each library's dependencies installed.\n\n**Step 5 \u2013 10-second validation runs** (all stored in `fuzz.log`):\n- **arrow**: 201k runs, cov=223 \u2014 \u2705 clean\n- **black**: ran and discovered a real `KeyError: '~='` bug in black \u2014 \u2705 fuzzer functional\n- **ipython**: 85k runs, cov=314 \u2014 \u2705 clean\n- **minisgl**: 167k runs, cov=323 \u2014 \u2705 clean\n- **ujson**: 4.4M runs (fast C ext), cov=10 \u2014 \u2705 clean\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "============================= test session starts =======================