{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz20__easy__s4", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 20, "noise_mode": "easy", "seed": 4, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [10], "n_candidates": 20, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 354.4, "agent_stdout_tail": "All formulas are correctly entered in `gdp.xlsx`. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 Data lookup (H12:L17, H19:L24, H26:L31):**\nUsed `INDEX/MATCH` with two conditions:\n```\n=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0), MATCH(H$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0))\n```\n- Rows locked on series code column `$D` (e.g., `466BXGS_BP6.A`)\n- Columns locked on year row `$9` (2019\u20132023)\n- Both anchored properly for copy-across/copy-down\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 Net exports as % of GDP (H35:L40):**\n```\n=(H12-H19)/H26*100\n```\nExports minus imports divided by GDP \u00d7 100 for each country/year. Plus statistics:\n- `=MIN`, `=MAX`, `=MEDIAN`, `=AVERAGE` for rows 42\u201345\n- `=PERCENTILE(...,0.25)` and `=PERCENTILE(...,0.75)` for rows 46\u201347\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 GDP-weighted mean (H50:L50):**\n```\n=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31,H35:H40)/SUM(H26:H31)\n```\nWeights each country's net exports % by its nominal GDP, yielding the GCC aggregate weighted mean (~12.2% in 2019, ~6.8% in 2020, ~15.6% in 2021, ~22.3% in 2022, ~14.9% in 2023).\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_exports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_imports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_gdp_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2NetExportsCalculation::test_net_exports_pct_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2Statistics::test_statistics_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep3WeightedMean::test_weighted_mean_has_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStru