{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz50__random__s0", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 50, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 0, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [49], "n_candidates": 50, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 266.6, "agent_stdout_tail": "All three steps are complete. Here's a summary of what was done to `gdp.xlsx`:\n\n---\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 INDEX+MATCH lookup formulas (H12:L17, H19:L24, H26:L31)**\n\nEach yellow cell uses a dual-condition INDEX+MATCH:\n```\n=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D<row>, Data!$B$21:$B$40, 0), MATCH(<year>$9, Data!$H$4:$M$4, 0))\n```\n- First MATCH finds the correct **row** by matching the series code (column D of Task) against column B of the Data sheet.\n- Second MATCH finds the correct **column** by matching the year header (row 9 of Task) against the year headers in Data row 4.\n- Covers all 6 GCC countries \u00d7 5 years (2019\u20132023) for Exports, Imports, and GDP.\n\n---\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 Net exports as % of GDP (H35:L40) + Statistics (H42:L47)**\n\n- Net exports %: `=(H12-H19)/H26*100` (exports minus imports, divided by GDP, \u00d7 100) \u2014 with appropriate row references per country.\n- MIN / MAX / MEDIAN / AVERAGE / PERCENTILE(0.25) / PERCENTILE(0.75) over the 6-country range for each year.\n\n---\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 GDP-weighted mean (H50:L50)**\n\n```\n=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31, H35:H40) / SUM(H26:H31)\n```\nEach country's net-export % is weighted by its nominal GDP share, giving the GCC-aggregate weighted mean.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_exports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_imports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_gdp_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2NetExportsCalculation::test_net_exports_pct_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2Statistics::test_statistics_have_data\nPASSED .test