{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz50__random__s3", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 50, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 3, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [17], "n_candidates": 50, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 183.1, "agent_stdout_tail": "All formulas are correctly written to `gdp.xlsx`. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 `H12:L17`, `H19:L24`, `H26:L31` (INDEX/MATCH lookups):**\nEach cell uses:\n```\n=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D{row}, Data!$B$21:$B$40, 0), MATCH({col}$9, Data!$H$4:$M$4, 0))\n```\n- Row-lookup: matches the series code in column D against `Data!$B$21:$B$40`\n- Column-lookup: matches the year in row 9 against the year headers in `Data!$H$4:$M$4`\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 `H35:L40` (Net exports % of GDP):**\nEach cell computes `=(Exports \u2212 Imports) / GDP \u00d7 100`, e.g. for UAE/2019: `=(H12-H19)/H26*100`\n\nStatistics (rows 42\u201347): `MIN`, `MAX`, `MEDIAN`, `AVERAGE`, `PERCENTILE(...,0.25)`, `PERCENTILE(...,0.75)` over `H35:H40` through `L35:L40`.\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 Row 50 (GDP-weighted mean):**\n```\n=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31, H35:H40) / SUM(H26:H31)\n```\nWeights each country's net-export share by its GDP. For 2019, this yields **\u2248 12.2%**.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_exports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_imports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_gdp_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2NetExportsCalculation::test_net_exports_pct_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2Statistics::test_statistics_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep3WeightedMean::test_weighted_mean_has_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestNoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_no_extra_sheets_added\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure