{"trial_id": "sb__setup-fuzzing-py__sz10__easy__s1", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "setup-fuzzing-py", "pool_size": 10, "noise_mode": "easy", "seed": 1, "gt_slugs": ["discover-important-function", "fuzzing-python", "setup-env"], "gt_positions": [1, 3, 4], "n_candidates": 10, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 761.3, "agent_stdout_tail": "All 5 steps are complete. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Summary\n\n### Step 1: Libraries listed\n`/app/libraries.txt` contains paths to all 5 libraries: arrow, black, ipython, minisgl, ujson.\n\n### Step 2: Analysis notes written\nEach `/app/<lib>/notes_for_testing.txt` documents:\n- Key files and functions (parsers, decoders, validators)\n- Primary fuzzing targets with rationale\n- Expected/unexpected exception handling\n- Fuzz strategy\n\n### Step 3: Fuzz drivers written (`/app/<lib>/fuzz.py`)\n- **arrow**: Fuzzes `arrow.get()`, `DateTimeParser.parse_iso()`, `DateTimeParser.parse()` with unicode strings\n- **black**: Fuzzes `black.format_str()`, `lib2to3_parse()`, `decode_bytes()` with arbitrary Python source\n- **ipython**: Fuzzes `TransformerManager.transform_cell()`, `check_complete()`, `has_open_quotes()`\n- **minisgl**: Fuzzes `_deserialize_any()`, `_serialize_any()`, `SamplingParams` construction\n- **ujson**: Fuzzes `ujson.loads()` (C extension, primary attack surface), round-trip encoding\n\n### Step 4: Virtual environments set up\nEach library has `.venv` with Python 3.12, the library itself, and atheris 3.0.0 installed.\n\n### Step 5: Fuzzer validation (10-second runs)\n| Library | Runs | Time |\n|---------|------|------|\n| arrow | 82,769 | 11s |\n| black | 40,666 | 11s |\n| ipython | 62,877 | 11s |\n| minisgl | 534,468 | 11s |\n| ujson | 5,069,547 | 11s |\n\nAll fuzz logs captured in `/app/<lib>/fuzz.log`.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "============================= test session starts ==============================\ncollecting ... collected 0 items\n\n============================ no tests ran in 0.00s =============================\n\n--- stderr ---\nERROR: file or directory not found: /tmp/exec_prefill/sb__setup-fuzzing-py__sz10__easy__s1/work/.tests/test_outputs.py\n\n", "system_prompt_chars": 37503}
