{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz100__random__s2", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 100, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 2, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [65], "n_candidates": 100, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 331.1, "agent_stdout_tail": "All 155 cells are filled correctly. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 Data population (H12:L17, H19:L24, H26:L31):**\n`=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D{row}, Data!$B$21:$B$40, 0), MATCH({col}$9, Data!$H$4:$M$4, 0))`\n- Two-condition INDEX/MATCH: series code from Task column D matched against Data column B, year from Task row 9 matched against Data row 4 year headers.\n- Proper mixed references (`$D` locks the series code column; `$9` locks the year row) so formulas copy correctly across both rows and columns.\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 Net exports as % of GDP (H35:L40):**\n`=({col}{exports_row} - {col}{imports_row}) / {col}{gdp_row} * 100`\n- Each country's (Exports \u2212 Imports) / GDP \u00d7 100, with exports/imports/GDP pulled from the corresponding lookup rows above.\n\n**Statistics (H42:L47):** MIN, MAX, MEDIAN, AVERAGE, PERCENTILE(0.25), PERCENTILE(0.75) over the six GCC countries for each year.\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 GDP-weighted mean (H50:L50):**\n`=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31, H35:H40) / SUM(H26:H31)`\n- Weights each country's net-export percentage by its nominal GDP, yielding the GCC aggregate weighted mean per year.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_exports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_imports_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep1LookupFormulas::test_gdp_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2NetExportsCalculation::test_net_exports_pct_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep2Statistics::test_statistics_have_data\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestStep3WeightedMean::test_weighted_mean_has_data\nPASSED .tests/