{"trial_id": "sb__weighted-gdp-calc__sz100__random__s3", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "weighted-gdp-calc", "pool_size": 100, "noise_mode": "random", "seed": 3, "gt_slugs": ["xlsx"], "gt_positions": [57], "n_candidates": 100, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 507.7, "agent_stdout_tail": "All three steps are complete. Here's a summary of what was done in `gdp.xlsx`:\n\n**Step 1 \u2014 `H12:L17`, `H19:L24`, `H26:L31`**\nFilled with `INDEX/MATCH` formulas using two conditions: series code (column D) and year (row 9). Example:\n```\n=INDEX(Data!$H$21:$M$40, MATCH($D12,Data!$B$21:$B$40,0), MATCH(H$9,Data!$H$4:$M$4,0))\n```\n\n**Step 2 \u2014 `H35:L40` (Net Exports % of GDP)**\nNet exports formula: `=(exports \u2212 imports) / GDP \u00d7 100`, e.g. `=(H12-H19)/H26*100`\n\nStatistics computed for 2019\u20132023:\n| Statistic | 2019 | 2020 | 2021 | 2022 | 2023 |\n|-----------|------|------|------|------|------|\n| Min | 7.98% | 0.09% | 8.35% | 16.93% | 7.17% |\n| Max | 19.74% | 21.92% | 25.22% | 36.90% | 27.47% |\n| Median | 12.55% | 5.62% | 20.97% | 25.36% | 19.11% |\n| Mean | 13.07% | 7.32% | 18.47% | 25.84% | 18.46% |\n| P25 | 11.57% | 3.24% | 12.83% | 21.48% | 15.41% |\n| P75 | 13.91% | 7.57% | 24.12% | 29.06% | 22.59% |\n\n**Step 3 \u2014 `H50:L50` (GDP-Weighted Mean)**\nFormula: `=SUMPRODUCT(H26:H31, H35:H40)/SUM(H26:H31)`\n\n| 2019 | 2020 | 2021 | 2022 | 2023 |\n|------|------|------|------|------|\n| **12.22%** | **6.84%** | **15.58%** | **22.35%** | **14.86%** |\n\nThe original formatting (yellow cells, fonts, colors) has been fully preserved.\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "NoExcelErrors::test_no_formula_errors\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_no_extra_sheets_added\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestSheetStructure::test_required_sheets_exist\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestFormattingPreserved::test_task_sheet_column_widths\nPASSED .tests/test_outputs.py::TestFormattingPreserved::te