{"trial_id": "sb__setup-fuzzing-py__sz10__easy__s4", "dataset": "sb", "task_id": "setup-fuzzing-py", "pool_size": 10, "noise_mode": "easy", "seed": 4, "gt_slugs": ["discover-important-function", "fuzzing-python", "setup-env"], "gt_positions": [1, 3, 8], "n_candidates": 10, "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6", "agent_rc": 0, "agent_wall_s": 863.9, "agent_stdout_tail": "All steps completed successfully:\n\n**Step 1** \u2014 `libraries.txt` lists all 5 library paths under `app/`.\n\n**Step 2** \u2014 `notes_for_testing.txt` written for each library:\n- **arrow**: targets `DateTimeParser.parse()`, `parse_iso()`, `ArrowFactory.get()`\n- **black**: targets `format_str()`, `decode_bytes()`\n- **ipython**: targets `TransformerManager.transform_cell()`, `check_complete()`\n- **minisgl**: targets `deserialize_type()`, `serialize_type()`, `SamplingParams`\n- **ujson**: targets `ujson.loads()`, `ujson.dumps()` (C extension round-trip)\n\n**Step 3** \u2014 `fuzz.py` written for each library using Atheris/LibFuzzer with `FuzzedDataProvider` for structured input generation and proper exception handling.\n\n**Step 4** \u2014 `.venv` created for each library via `uv venv` + package installation:\n- arrow: arrow + dateutil + atheris\n- black: black (with all formatting deps) + atheris\n- ipython: IPython + traitlets + pygments + atheris\n- minisgl: torch (CPU) + numpy + msgpack + atheris (torch pre-imported before instrumentation to avoid slow module scanning)\n- ujson: ujson (C extension built from source) + atheris\n\n**Step 5** \u2014 All 5 fuzzers validated, each ran ~10 seconds:\n| Library | Runs | Exec/sec |\n|---------|------|----------|\n| arrow | 196,826 | 17,893 |\n| black | 48,600 | 4,418 |\n| ipython | 75,826 | 6,893 |\n| minisgl | 3,583,962 | 325,814 |\n| ujson | 5,662,754 | 514,795 |\n", "agent_stderr_tail": "", "pass": false, "test_log_tail": "============================= test session starts ==============================\ncollecting ... collected 0 items\n\n================